#: behaviour.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Behavior</h1> You can configure how Konqueror behaves as a "
"file manager here."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:45
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "Ҳар хил параметрлар"

#: behaviour.cpp:54
msgid "Open folders in separate &windows"
msgstr "Жилдларни &алоҳида ойнада очиш"

#: behaviour.cpp:55
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"folder, rather than showing that folder's contents in the current window."
msgstr "Агар белгиланса, жилд очилганда Konqueror уни янги ойнада кўрсатади."

#: behaviour.cpp:62
msgid "&Show network operations in a single window"
msgstr "&Тармоқ амаллар битта ойнада"

#: behaviour.cpp:65
msgid ""
"Checking this option will group the progress information for all network "
"file transfers into a single window with a list. When the option is not "
"checked, all transfers appear in a separate window."
msgstr ""
"Агар белгиланса, ҳамма тармоқ амаллари битта ойнада кўринади. Акс ҳолда, "
"улар алоҳида ойнада кўринади."

#: behaviour.cpp:72
msgid "Show file &tips"
msgstr "&Файл ҳақида қўшимча маълумотни кўрсатиш"

#: behaviour.cpp:75
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see "
"a small popup window with additional information about that file"
msgstr ""
"Агар белгиланса, сичқонча файлнинг устида бўлганда у ҳақида қўшимча маълумот "
"кўрсатилади."

#: behaviour.cpp:99
msgid "Show &previews in file tips"
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:102
msgid ""
"Here you can control if you want the popup window to contain a larger "
"preview for the file, when moving the mouse over it."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:110
msgid "Rename icons in&line"
msgstr "Нишончаларнинг номини &жойида ўзгартириш"

#: behaviour.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Checking this option will allow files to be renamed by clicking directly on "
"the icon name. "
msgstr ""
"Агар белгиланса, нишончанинг номини бир марта босиб файлнинг номини "
"ўзгартирса бўлади."

#: behaviour.cpp:126
msgid "Home &URL:"
msgstr "&Уй URL:"

#: behaviour.cpp:131
msgid "Select Home Folder"
msgstr "Уй жилдини танланг"

#: behaviour.cpp:138
msgid ""
"This is the URL (e.g. a folder or a web page) where Konqueror will jump to "
"when the \"Home\" button is pressed. This is usually your home folder, "
"symbolized by a 'tilde' (~)."
msgstr ""
"Уй тугмаси босилганида пайдо бўладиган манзил (м-н жилд ёки веб-саҳифа). "
"Одатда, бунинг қиймати уй жилдига (~) ўрнатилган бўлади."

#: behaviour.cpp:146
msgid "Show 'Delete' context me&nu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr "&Контекст менюда ўчириш бандини кўрсатиш"

#: behaviour.cpp:150
msgid ""
"Check this if you want 'Delete' menu commands to be displayed on the desktop "
"and in the file manager's context menus. You can always delete files by "
"holding the Shift key while calling 'Move to Trash'."
msgstr ""
"Агар белгиланса, иш столи ёки файл-браузернинг контекст менюсида ўчириш "
"банди кўринади."

#: behaviour.cpp:156
msgid "Ask Confirmation For"
msgstr "Тасдиқлаш учун сўраш"

#: behaviour.cpp:157
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"\"delete\" a file. <ul><li><em>Move To Trash:</em> moves the file to your "
"trash folder, from where it can be recovered very easily.</li> "
"<li><em>Delete:</em> simply deletes the file.</li> </li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:164
msgid "&Move to trash"
msgstr "Чиқиндилар қути&сига кўчириш"

#: behaviour.cpp:167
msgid "D&elete"
msgstr "Ў&чириш"

#: browser.cpp:59
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "&Кўриниши"

#: browser.cpp:60
msgid "&Behavior"
msgstr "&Хусусиятлар"

#: browser.cpp:61
msgid "&Previews && Meta-Data"
msgstr "&Кўриб чиқишлар ва мета-маълумот"

#: desktop.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<h1>Multiple Desktops</h1>In this module, you can configure how many virtual "
"desktops you want and how these should be labeled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Бир нечта иш столлари</h1>Бу мослама ёрдамида виртуал иш столларнинг "
"сони ва улларнинг номини мослаш мумкин."

#: desktop.cpp:77
msgid "N&umber of desktops: "
msgstr "&Иш столлар сони: "

#: desktop.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Here you can set how many virtual desktops you want on your KDE desktop. "
"Move the slider to change the value."
msgstr ""

#: desktop.cpp:94
msgid "Desktop &Names"
msgstr "Иш столининг &номлари"

#: desktop.cpp:100 desktop.cpp:102
#, qt-format
msgid "Desktop %1:"
msgstr "Иш столи %1:"

#: desktop.cpp:104 desktop.cpp:105 desktop.cpp:106 desktop.cpp:107
#, qt-format
msgid "Here you can enter the name for desktop %1"
msgstr "Бу ерда %1чи иш столининг номни кўрсатиш мумкин."

#: desktop.cpp:120
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr ""

#: desktop.cpp:235 desktop.cpp:253
#, qt-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "Иш столи %1"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:85
msgid "Sound Files"
msgstr "Товуш файллари"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:145
msgid "&Left button:"
msgstr "Ч&ап тугма:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:146
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:149
msgid "Right b&utton:"
msgstr "Ўн&г тугма:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:150
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:166
msgid ""
" <ul><li><em>No action</em></li> <li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu "
"showing all windows on all virtual desktops pops up. You can click on the "
"desktop name to switch to that desktop, or on a window name to shift focus "
"to that window, switching desktops if necessary, and restoring the window if "
"it is hidden. Hidden or minimized windows are represented with their names "
"in parentheses.</li> <li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the "
"desktop pops up. Among other things, this menu has options for configuring "
"the display, locking the screen, and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful "
"for quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known "
"as \"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:187
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your "
"pointing device on the desktop: <ul><li><em>No action</em></li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that "
"desktop, or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching "
"desktops if necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or "
"minimized windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among "
"other things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the "
"screen, and logging out of KDE.</li> <li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K"
"\" menu pops up. This might be useful for quickly accessing applications if "
"you like to keep the panel (also known as \"Kicker\") hidden from view.</"
"li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:212
msgid ""
" <ul><li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that "
"desktop, or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching "
"desktops if necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or "
"minimized windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among "
"other things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the "
"screen, and logging out of KDE.</li> <li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K"
"\" menu pops up. This might be useful for quickly accessing applications if "
"you like to keep the panel (also known as \"Kicker\") hidden from view.</"
"li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:278
msgid "No Action"
msgstr "Амал йўқ"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:279
msgid "Window List Menu"
msgstr "Ойналар рўйхати менюси"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:280
msgid "Desktop Menu"
msgstr "Иш столи менюси"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:281
msgid "Application Menu"
msgstr "Дастур менюси"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:282
msgid "Bookmarks Menu"
msgstr "Хатчўплар менюси"

